gameDescriptionHtml:
Get ready for an unforgettable adventure! Here is the most complete edition of the award-winning role-playing game Persona 5 Royal, which contains just a sea of downloadable content!<p></p>
<p>The main character is a high school student who was forced to move to Tokyo and transfer to one of the city schools. Soon after, he has a strange dream: a mysterious voice calls him a prisoner of fate and informs him that in the near future the young man is waiting for a catastrophe. Now, in order to undergo a course of “rehabilitation”, he must save people from their own vicious desires by trying on the mask of the Phantom Kidnapper.</p>
<p><b>Game Features</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Explore Tokyo, equip the lair of the Kidnappers, unlock new personas and unlock alternate endings;
</li><li>In the full edition of Persona 5 Royal, you can become the best Phantom Kidnapper and challenge generally accepted norms by discovering a hidden power and fighting for justice;
</li><li>Contains more than 40 items from previously released downloadable content;
</li><li>Voice acting is available in Japanese and English.
</li></ul>
